   "texts": [
    "Lifecycle management for snapshots",
    "Use Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager (Amazon DLM) to automate",
    "the creation, retention, and deletion of snapshots.",
    "Amazon DLM uses tags to identify EBS volumes to back up.",
    "Define the desired backup and retention actions to Amazon DLM in a",
    "lifecycle policy.",
    "Resource type",
    "Target tag",
    "Schedule"
   ],
